{"id":773199,"title":"41｜发布到微信公众号（订阅号）","content":"本节课介绍了将机器人发布到微信订阅号的步骤及注意事项。首先，在平台选择微信公众号订阅号后，需进入微信公众平台使用管理员账号扫码登录。接着，在设置与开发的基本配置中复制开发者ID并粘贴保存。若APPID已绑定其他账号，则需先解绑再重新授权。完成授权后，再次点击发布并勾选立即对话选项。测试过程中发现，机器人对文本信息的响应较慢，且目前无法识别通过PC或手机上传的图片内容。此外，当机器人试图返回图片时，仅能提供URL而非直接展示图片。这些限制期待未来得到解决。课程最后提醒了两个关键点：一是当前上传图片解析存在问题；二是机器人返回图片形式为URL链接。下节课将讲解如何将机器人发布到掘金平台上。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":403740,"user_name":"田凯","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":2693558,"ip_address":"湖南","ucode":"F09CC5177021BB","user_header":"","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1764645986,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":146777,"content":"没明白，什么是AI自动生成的消息，什么场景下","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1224950,"ctime":1764686348,"ip_address":"北京","comment_id":403740,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":3,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100760301,"comment_content":"请问怎么屏蔽由AI自动生成的消息","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1224950,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/b0/f6/eb6a8f61.jpg","nickname":"郭旭","note":"","ucode":"7CC6787BD0F0A9","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":675070,"discussion_content":"没明白，什么是AI自动生成的消息，什么场景下","content_length":62,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1764686348,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"北京","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":2,"child_discussions":[{"author":{"id":2693558,"avatar":"","nickname":"田凯","note":"","ucode":"F09CC5177021BB","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":1224950,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/b0/f6/eb6a8f61.jpg","nickname":"郭旭","note":"","ucode":"7CC6787BD0F0A9","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":67